    O\tmessage-line\tchoice\ts\t\t\t0,1,2,3,4\tPosition (line) of messages and the command prompt.
    O\tmessage-style\tstring\ts\ts\t\t\tStyle of messages and the command prompt. A 'fill' attribute controls background clearing and a 'width' attribute (fixed or percentage) constrains the prompt area width.
